        <!-- Right: short pitch -->
        <div class="hero-pitch">
          <p class="open-pill"><span class="dot"></span> Open to AI / Software Engineer roles</p>
          <h2>AI &amp; Software Engineer</h2>
          <p>
            BCA (AI &amp; ML) student. I train machine learning models with Scikit-learn,
