          </p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View projects</a>
            <a href="Aman_Bhushan_CV.docx" class="btn btn-outline" download="Aman_Bhushan_CV.docx">Download CV</a>
